  "analytical_usefulness": 0.7,
  "source_groundedness": 0.8,
  "rationale": "Most added columns provide genuine new axes (specificity, purpose, origin, presence flags) relevant to predicting declines, though several skew toward the asset/hardware framing rather than the travel-expense focus of the query. Groundedness is generally strong—extractions from ci and short_description are sound and silent rows are handled with Unknown/NULL—but some categorical judgments (procurement vs registration, description_specificity) are applied inconsistently across near-identical source text, and department_group values are not verifiable from the provided evidence."
